    "title": "Gov. Pritzker set to announce run for third term amid presidential speculation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Illinois\nGov. Pritzker set to announce run for third term amid presidential speculation\nBy NBC Chicago Staff,\n34 minutes agoIllinois Gov. J.B. Pritzker will kick off his bid for a third term in office Thursday amid speculation over whether his sights are set even higher. Pritzker is expected to make the announcement in a press event and rally, according to NBC 5 Political Reporter Mary Ann Ahern, and while the decision wasn’t much of a surprise, there are still plenty of questions that he will have to answer in the run-up to the 2026 election.",
